{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">名古屋亞運，杜凱琹及吳詠琳乒乓女雙四強止步，獲得銅牌。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">世界第三的杜凱琹及吳詠琳，晉級過程淘汰烏茲別克、韓國的金娜英及李恩惠，以及新加坡組合。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">四強面對「世一」、東道主日本的早田希娜及張本美和，最終直落四局落敗，不設銅牌戰之下，協助港隊繼2014年再奪亞運女雙銅牌。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"Picture_JS.AG.TT-2100_001.jpg\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/2026FdqqdFEfr91790603805.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"Picture_JS.AG.TT-2100_001.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">電競港隊在《王者榮耀國際服》，四強不敵馬來西亞亦奪銅，兩隊銅牌得主，同樣獲賽馬會50萬元獎金。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"Picture_JS.AG.TT-2100_002.jpg\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/2026A5tS8pYylX1790603797.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"Picture_JS.AG.TT-2100_002.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-28T14:20:00.268931+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":181,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}